<title>USA: Entergy Corp opens Australian office.</title>
<headline>Entergy Corp opens Australian office.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entergy Corp said its power development arm, Entergy Power Group, has established a regional headquarters in Sydney, Australia, in the state of New South Wales. -- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
